<font size=2>[155]</font> <font size=4 color=#40c0c0> むう。</font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=1 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td nowrap>
<font size=3 color=#606060><strong>▽</strong> 2003/06/07 (土) 23:38:25 <strong>▽</strong> ROM </font></td>
<td nowrap align=right><font size=3>　<a href="bbs.cgi?res=200306076233825&log=yamu">返信</a>　削除<input type=checkbox name="target" value="200306076233825"></font>
</td></table>
<table border=0 cellpadding=16 cellspacing=0 width=100%><td>
